 "summary": "Seven single rectifier diodes in the two-terminal DO-214AB (SMC) molded package, all rated 3.0 A average forward current and 90 A surge, told apart only by reverse voltage, from 50 V (S3AC) to 1000 V (S3MC). Forward drop is at most 1.0 V at 3.0 A; reverse leakage at rated DC voltage is at most 5 µA at 25 °C and 100 µA at 125 °C. S3JC is the 600 V type.",
